渐次后退；她稳步向前，直至 10.00 秒镜头结束。\n\noverall_soundscape: 雨持续敲打伞面与湿地面，远处车流与微弱城市底噪隐约可闻；轻步踩在浸湿的人行道上溅起水声，衣料随步伐摩挲。\n\nnon_diegetic_music: 一段稀疏、忧郁的混响独奏钢琴以慢速奏出，音符间隔宽广，临近结尾轻轻涌起后淡出。\n", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 239, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 240, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 271, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 275, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 273, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 274, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 245, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 133, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [271], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [450, 630], "pos": [-1376.6842041015625, 4833.23974609375], "widgets_values": ["ca81bfa37d584b394a6632c72fc38348d10ecddb7e6e49a2e7ed72607d9194b6.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 114, "type": "Loa